170149:
**Location:** At the end of a secret passage. From the [Volcano Manor](#loc=164575) Site of Grace:
- Go down the hallway to the west, and take the first door on the right;
- Continue into the room with three snails;
- Take the path to the left that is lit with a red torch;
- The cookbook is on a corpse, at the end of the hallway.  

**Recipes:**
- Alluring Pot
